# v1.10.0:
- Update for game version 1.3+
- Add new interactions to take command of subject troops

# v1.9.8:
- Remove duplicate move subject capital interaction (added by vanilla in v1.2)

# v1.9.7:
- Update for game version 1.2+

# v1.9.6:
- Prevent deactivation of global subject blockers.
- Disable rename subjects in multiplayer (since it doesn't work)

# v1.9.5:
- Fix global block urbanization, colonization, and columbian exchange settings

# v1.9.4:
- Fix take over subject wars not properly joining overlord into wars
- Fix block all subjects from declaring wars
- Rename "Transfer Land" interactions to "Give Land" / "Take Land"

# v1.9.3
- Attempt to fix auto-rivalling of subjects on taking over their wars (caused by vanilla game effect)
- Add missing dependency notice

# v1.9.2:
- Remove some unused temporary files

# v1.9.1:
- Fix auto takeover war automation

# v1.9.0
[b]Major Release v1.9.0:[/b]
- [b]New mod menu[/b] integrated with the [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3692202776]Community Mod Framework[/url]
- [b]New automation[/b] to automatically join / take over subject wars
- [b]New settings[/b] to control automatic map sharing
- [b]New subject rights customization[/b] for blocking colonization, urbanization, columbian exchange, and declaring war for all subjects.
- [b]New dynamic interactions[/b] which hide when the global subject rights supersede them.

[b]Important:[/b] This new update relies on the [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3692202776]Community Mod Framework[/url] and is now a required dependency.
